{"id":"user-turn-51d85b4feb632adf4c25d0f2d2a5b898-1","sessionId":"29445a83-8437-abd8-4bbb-0f2482d3ce8a","turnId":"turn-51d85b4feb632adf4c25d0f2d2a5b898","inputEntryId":null,"createdAt":1794273799259,"updatedAt":1794273799259,"generationStatus":"completed","relatedEntryId":null,"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Since the bot got long-term memory, every save_fact makes the next call pay full price for the whole system prompt (logs/usage.jsonl). Fix the caching so a memory write doesn't evict the static instructions. Write what you changed in ANSWER.md.\n\nGround rules: work only inside the current directory. Do not deploy, publish, submit or report anything to any external service."}],"source":"turn_start","userDisplayContent":null,"outcome":null}
